# 🚢 Titanic Survival Prediction Using Machine Learning

## 📌 Project Overview

This project predicts whether a passenger would survive the Titanic disaster using Machine Learning. The model is trained on the Titanic dataset and deployed using a Flask web application. Users can enter passenger details through a web interface and receive an instant prediction.

The project follows a complete Machine Learning workflow including data preprocessing, feature engineering, model training, model serialization using Pickle, and deployment with Flask.

