## 🔮 Prediction Workflow

1. User enters passenger details.
2. Flask receives form data.
3. Input features are converted into NumPy array.
4. Data is scaled using StandardScaler.
5. Random Forest model predicts survival.
6. Result is displayed on the webpage.

